      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. one more thing though—sometimes even with low fees, clients feel like they're getting nickel and dimed by things they didn't see coming. are there any common \"hidden\" issues or specific ways these costs can sneak up on an investor in either type? maybe just a few bullet points on what to watch out for.",
